WEBVTT

00:00:16.280 --> 00:00:22.690
O flower, parched in the light of dawn,

00:00:22.920 --> 00:00:26.370
reaching for the unfallen rain,

00:00:26.370 --> 00:00:33.420
fall into a wakeless sleep.

00:00:43.970 --> 00:00:47.330
Someone calls out softly for a paradise of darkness.

00:00:47.330 --> 00:00:48.980
Is it a lie or a dream?

00:00:48.980 --> 00:00:51.210
Either way, it's already lost.

00:00:51.210 --> 00:00:57.130
What do you gain by putting forth your heart?

00:00:57.480 --> 00:01:01.200
Looking through those eyes,

00:01:01.200 --> 00:01:04.300
life is foolish and fleeting enough to snatch away.

00:01:04.300 --> 00:01:07.830
Will today be the day you grieve the end

00:01:07.830 --> 00:01:11.040
which comes to us all?

00:01:11.040 --> 00:01:14.640
The calendula which sings of the abyss

00:01:14.640 --> 00:01:18.300
silently blooms full.

00:01:18.300 --> 00:01:21.470
Hatred and sadness

00:01:21.470 --> 00:01:25.180
are bound together in those eyes.

00:01:25.180 --> 00:01:28.320
The calendula which sings of demise

00:01:28.320 --> 00:01:31.930
is watered by solitude,

00:01:31.930 --> 00:01:35.170
reaching for the unfallen rain,

00:01:35.170 --> 00:01:41.600
fall into a wakeless sleep.

00:02:03.170 --> 00:02:04.390
See you later!

00:02:04.390 --> 00:02:05.090
Okay!

00:02:05.090 --> 00:02:05.910
Bye!

00:02:05.910 --> 00:02:07.510
Wait! Shigeki, Shihori...

00:02:07.870 --> 00:02:08.810
What?

00:02:08.810 --> 00:02:11.980
Don't play by the highway! It's dangerous!

00:02:11.980 --> 00:02:13.080
There was an accident just the other day.

00:02:13.080 --> 00:02:15.030
Okay, Mom!

00:02:15.030 --> 00:02:15.890
Right?

00:02:15.890 --> 00:02:17.280
Yeah.

00:02:32.320 --> 00:02:33.790
What's today's special?

00:02:33.790 --> 00:02:35.550
Chicken grilled with ginger!

00:02:35.550 --> 00:02:36.280
Hi!

00:02:36.280 --> 00:02:37.800
Hey, you're two minutes late!

00:02:37.800 --> 00:02:38.850
Sorry.

00:02:38.850 --> 00:02:41.050
Shigeki was playing around.

00:02:41.050 --> 00:02:42.060
Welcome!

00:02:42.380 --> 00:02:45.060
You walked your kids to school again?

00:02:45.060 --> 00:02:46.080
Yeah.

00:02:46.080 --> 00:02:47.970
You worry too much.

00:02:47.970 --> 00:02:52.610
The highway isn't even on their way.

00:02:52.610 --> 00:02:53.320
But...

00:02:53.320 --> 00:02:55.090
Don't worry, Moto-chan.

00:02:55.090 --> 00:02:57.820
Everyone here's a safe driver.

00:02:57.820 --> 00:03:04.510
But it's still dangerous. What if some stranger comes flying through?

00:03:04.510 --> 00:03:06.330
Motoko.

00:03:06.630 --> 00:03:08.930
They're good kids.

00:03:08.930 --> 00:03:10.580
They're not going to go play in the highway.

00:03:23.750 --> 00:03:24.850
Outsiders?

00:03:24.850 --> 00:03:27.790
They're moving in.

00:03:27.790 --> 00:03:29.850
They woke me up in the middle of the night!

00:03:35.360 --> 00:03:37.760
Motoko, can you take over for a few?

00:03:37.760 --> 00:03:38.570
Sure.

00:03:38.570 --> 00:03:40.860
Sorry, I hate dropping it all in your lap.

00:03:40.860 --> 00:03:42.430
Don't worry.

00:03:43.850 --> 00:03:47.370
How old was the Shimizu-san's daughter, anyway?

00:03:47.370 --> 00:03:49.580
Megumi-chan was a high school freshman.

00:03:49.580 --> 00:03:53.310
I don't understand why she died.

00:03:53.310 --> 00:03:55.130
Mom.

00:03:59.700 --> 00:04:02.380
There's been so many funerals lately.

00:04:02.380 --> 00:04:04.930
Old people and children too.

00:04:04.930 --> 00:04:06.390
I wonder what's going on?

00:04:12.650 --> 00:04:14.140
Dad...

00:04:14.800 --> 00:04:16.850
Why don't you go to the hospital?

00:04:16.850 --> 00:04:19.800
The summer flu's going around, you know.

00:04:22.320 --> 00:04:26.110
I feel fine.

00:04:26.110 --> 00:04:28.120
That's right, Motoko-san!

00:04:28.120 --> 00:04:30.660
He's still sound and hearty!

00:04:30.660 --> 00:04:33.070
You make such a fuss about these things!

00:04:33.070 --> 00:04:35.930
I hate how much of a worrywart you are!

00:04:36.800 --> 00:04:37.960
B-But...

00:04:37.960 --> 00:04:40.000
Shut up!

00:04:40.000 --> 00:04:41.920
I'll just go to bed early.

00:04:42.230 --> 00:04:43.930
That should do the trick.

00:04:48.050 --> 00:04:49.430
Was he ill?

00:04:49.760 --> 00:04:52.950
Yes. He'd been lethargic.

00:04:52.950 --> 00:04:53.950
Did he see a doctor?

00:04:53.950 --> 00:04:56.940
No, he said he just needed to rest.

00:04:57.890 --> 00:05:00.940
This isn't right! People don't just go to take a nap and then die!

00:05:01.320 --> 00:05:04.850
He was a healthy man! Letting a cold go shouldn't kill him like that!

00:05:04.850 --> 00:05:05.700
I guess.

00:05:05.700 --> 00:05:09.040
This seems to be a case of sudden heart failure.

00:05:09.040 --> 00:05:12.700
I'd like to conduct a pathological autopsy.

00:05:12.700 --> 00:05:15.710
An autopsy? Are you insane?!

00:05:16.210 --> 00:05:19.700
I won't let you slice my husband up!

00:05:19.700 --> 00:05:21.210
It's because he didn't visit a hospital.

00:05:21.840 --> 00:05:24.390
Listen, he wasn't under my care the day he died.

00:05:24.390 --> 00:05:28.720
That means I can't sign off on the death certificate without establishing the cause of death.

00:05:30.550 --> 00:05:31.680
Fine.

00:05:32.990 --> 00:05:35.600
This is why I hate doctors!

00:05:38.510 --> 00:05:41.860
So how much am I going to have to pay for the death certificate?

00:05:43.050 --> 00:05:44.860
It's not a matter of money!

00:05:45.430 --> 00:05:47.520
It always is.

00:05:47.520 --> 00:05:50.910
You won't give me a death certificate until you extract your pound of flesh, you ghoul.

00:05:53.880 --> 00:05:58.720
Listen, if your husband was so healthy, then why did he die?!

00:05:58.720 --> 00:06:00.970
There was something wrong with him!

00:06:00.970 --> 00:06:03.700
Don't you want to know what happened?!

00:06:03.700 --> 00:06:07.380
That won't bring him back to life!

00:06:08.740 --> 00:06:11.260
Yeah, you're right.

00:06:11.260 --> 00:06:15.390
But it sure as hell would have helped if he saw a doctor before he died.

00:06:23.130 --> 00:06:24.400
You—

00:06:25.140 --> 00:06:27.640
It's because you damn quacks are so pushy!

00:06:27.640 --> 00:06:32.100
You shove people into hospital beds, just to tell
them they're fine after you've gotten your money!

00:06:32.100 --> 00:06:34.410
That's why...

00:06:34.410 --> 00:06:35.010
That's why he...

00:06:35.010 --> 00:06:36.020
Mom...

00:06:36.020 --> 00:06:37.430
Gotcha!

00:06:38.840 --> 00:06:40.410
Don't touch it.

00:06:40.410 --> 00:06:42.720
Don't make a fuss indoors.

00:06:42.720 --> 00:06:43.790
Sorry.

00:06:44.590 --> 00:06:45.750
Look at what we caught!

00:06:45.750 --> 00:06:47.570
That's amazing.

00:06:47.570 --> 00:06:49.530
But you should let it go.

00:06:50.560 --> 00:06:52.060
Yeah.

00:06:52.060 --> 00:06:55.970
And stay away from Grandpa's room for a while, okay?

00:06:55.970 --> 00:06:56.810
Huh?

00:06:57.240 --> 00:06:58.310
Why?

00:06:58.310 --> 00:06:59.560
You'll find out later.

00:06:59.560 --> 00:07:02.220
Now let the dragonfly go.

00:07:11.890 --> 00:07:13.620
So early in the morning...

00:07:14.270 --> 00:07:17.030
Hello, Roadside Restaurant Chigusa.

00:07:17.030 --> 00:07:19.510
Kanami, something's wrong with Isami-san.

00:07:19.510 --> 00:07:21.770
Motoko? What's wrong?

00:07:21.770 --> 00:07:24.130
It's like he's dead.

00:07:26.520 --> 00:07:30.870
Don't worry. I called Dr. Ozaki.

00:07:30.870 --> 00:07:32.000
Where's your mother-in-law?

00:07:33.810 --> 00:07:36.710
Did you hear the rumor?

00:07:36.710 --> 00:07:37.970
What?

00:07:37.970 --> 00:07:40.400
They say there's an epidemic.

00:07:40.400 --> 00:07:41.190
Yeah.

00:07:41.190 --> 00:07:43.200
It started when the Kanemasa people moved in!

00:07:43.200 --> 00:07:43.900
Those outsiders...

00:07:44.330 --> 00:07:45.520
What are you talking about?

00:07:45.520 --> 00:07:48.100
The outsiders brought the disease...

00:07:48.100 --> 00:07:50.650
Get a hold of yourself! They have nothing to do with it!

00:07:51.240 --> 00:07:52.830
The children...

00:07:52.830 --> 00:07:54.160
The children!

00:07:57.710 --> 00:07:59.070
Mommy?

00:07:59.070 --> 00:08:00.550
What's wrong?

00:08:07.100 --> 00:08:11.100
Get up! Breakfast's ready!

00:08:11.100 --> 00:08:12.550
Okay!

00:08:41.470 --> 00:08:42.580
Doctor!

00:08:45.380 --> 00:08:46.830
No way!

00:08:50.000 --> 00:08:51.140
Doctor!

00:08:51.140 --> 00:08:53.040
This is Maeda from Shimo-Sotoba!

00:08:53.040 --> 00:08:54.560
That's unusual.

00:08:54.560 --> 00:08:57.390
He's been open on Saturdays lately.

00:08:57.390 --> 00:09:00.860
I've heard his wife is ill, maybe that's why.

00:09:00.860 --> 00:09:02.350
My daughter's ill too!

00:09:02.870 --> 00:09:05.380
That's not good.

00:09:05.380 --> 00:09:09.860
You know, I've heard they opened a clinic in the old gas station out by the highway.

00:09:10.560 --> 00:09:11.610
By the highway?

00:09:12.210 --> 00:09:14.360
I think it's run by the doctor at Kanemasa.

00:09:15.240 --> 00:09:16.860
An outside doctor?

00:09:18.970 --> 00:09:20.870
Why don't I show you the way?

00:09:29.500 --> 00:09:31.090
The Kanemasa...

00:09:43.590 --> 00:09:44.870
I can't believe it...

00:09:46.080 --> 00:09:47.700
I can't believe it!

00:09:49.110 --> 00:09:51.380
Open up! Please, open up!

00:09:51.380 --> 00:09:53.780
This is an emergency! My daughter—

00:09:53.780 --> 00:09:55.480
Open up!

00:09:55.480 --> 00:09:57.880
Open up! Open up!

00:09:57.880 --> 00:09:58.830
My daughter!

00:09:58.830 --> 00:10:00.280
Motoko-san!

00:10:03.370 --> 00:10:05.130
You're terrible!

00:10:07.800 --> 00:10:09.770
What's wrong? She doesn't even have a fever!

00:10:10.710 --> 00:10:12.290
You're fine, aren't you, Shihori?

00:10:12.860 --> 00:10:13.800
Yeah.

00:10:13.800 --> 00:10:15.860
I feel fine.

00:10:16.590 --> 00:10:17.930
Shihori?

00:10:18.220 --> 00:10:22.930
The more you seek attention, the worse things get!

00:10:22.930 --> 00:10:24.660
When are you going to learn?!

00:10:35.400 --> 00:10:39.450
Take care of Shihori while I'm out shopping, okay?

00:10:45.870 --> 00:10:48.320
What are you doing dozing off?!

00:10:48.320 --> 00:10:50.380
Get the hell up!

00:10:50.380 --> 00:10:54.830
You let Shihori die, you shriveled old cunt!

00:11:00.260 --> 00:11:02.970
Hello, is this the Sotoba Funeral Home?

00:11:03.630 --> 00:11:05.960
My mother-in-law is dead.

00:11:06.360 --> 00:11:08.280
I don't want to take care of her myself.

00:11:09.980 --> 00:11:11.790
I have a child here.

00:11:11.790 --> 00:11:13.980
Please come and do something quickly.

00:11:13.980 --> 00:11:19.520
I never knew Motoko-san was this superstitious.

00:11:20.990 --> 00:11:24.620
Maybe it's because of Iwao-san.

00:11:26.910 --> 00:11:30.520
Someone said they saw Iwao-san by the old well.

00:11:30.520 --> 00:11:33.800
I can't believe it myself.

00:11:33.800 --> 00:11:37.560
But a lot of rumors like that are going around...

00:11:39.220 --> 00:11:40.560
Oh?

00:11:40.560 --> 00:11:41.630
I knew it...

00:11:42.530 --> 00:11:47.210
You took Isami-san, Shihori, and everyone else with you.

00:11:52.190 --> 00:11:53.460
Mom...

00:11:56.500 --> 00:11:58.150
Don't worry, Shigeki.

00:12:07.850 --> 00:12:09.620
We'll be safe and sound in here.

00:12:10.600 --> 00:12:13.330
I'll protect you, Shigeki.

00:12:16.000 --> 00:12:18.760
I haven't seen Moto-chan lately.

00:12:18.760 --> 00:12:20.890
She quit.

00:12:20.890 --> 00:12:21.880
Really?

00:12:21.880 --> 00:12:24.050
She said she didn't even want to leave her house.

00:12:24.680 --> 00:12:26.070
I see.

00:12:26.070 --> 00:12:28.810
She's had such a hard time lately; I guess it makes sense.

00:12:29.670 --> 00:12:31.170
I guess...

00:12:33.480 --> 00:12:37.320
Mom, I've been thinking I should go see Motoko and—

00:12:40.020 --> 00:12:41.320
Mom?

00:12:41.960 --> 00:12:47.760
Doctor, I've heard the rumors about the epidemic, and...

00:12:47.760 --> 00:12:49.330
There isn't one.

00:12:50.400 --> 00:12:52.080
Doctor...

00:13:05.210 --> 00:13:09.220
Motoko... My mom died...

00:13:11.230 --> 00:13:12.220
Oh.

00:13:26.270 --> 00:13:27.490
What time is it?

00:13:27.490 --> 00:13:29.620
Who's there? Motoko?

00:13:33.580 --> 00:13:36.270
Ka... na... mi...

00:13:41.760 --> 00:13:45.190
Did I wake you up?

00:13:45.190 --> 00:13:46.260
Mom!

00:13:46.990 --> 00:13:48.460
Let's get you changed!

00:13:48.460 --> 00:13:50.260
You're all muddy.

00:13:51.090 --> 00:13:52.990
Did you fall asleep, Mom?

00:13:54.000 --> 00:13:57.330
Mom! If you're tired, you should go lay down.

00:14:02.280 --> 00:14:03.650
Mom!

00:14:06.880 --> 00:14:08.160
Mom!

00:14:36.250 --> 00:14:37.310
Mom...

00:14:37.770 --> 00:14:38.830
You're up now?

00:14:38.830 --> 00:14:40.230
Is your sunburn feeling better?

00:14:40.230 --> 00:14:41.310
Sunburn?

00:14:43.870 --> 00:14:45.320
Is there something you'd like?

00:14:45.320 --> 00:14:47.400
I'm hungry...

00:14:47.400 --> 00:14:49.820
Got it! I'll make you some porridge.

00:14:55.600 --> 00:14:56.820
That's funny...

00:14:58.200 --> 00:15:02.210
I can't eat it...

00:15:02.620 --> 00:15:03.710
Is it too hot?

00:15:06.810 --> 00:15:08.720
I don't understand...

00:15:10.530 --> 00:15:12.000
Kanami...

00:15:12.000 --> 00:15:13.570
What?

00:15:13.570 --> 00:15:15.710
What day is today?

00:15:17.960 --> 00:15:20.480
What was I doing yesterday?

00:15:21.490 --> 00:15:22.790
Yesterday?

00:15:22.790 --> 00:15:24.000
I dunno...

00:15:24.000 --> 00:15:26.150
It's funny.

00:15:26.150 --> 00:15:29.240
I feel like I haven't eaten anything.

00:15:31.710 --> 00:15:32.700
Mom!

00:15:45.680 --> 00:15:47.130
Save me!

00:15:47.130 --> 00:15:49.880
Save me, Kanami!

00:15:51.770 --> 00:15:54.890
Am I going to die?!

00:15:56.280 --> 00:15:59.600
Don't worry, your tummy's just a little upset.

00:15:59.600 --> 00:16:01.890
I'll make something thinner.

00:16:13.350 --> 00:16:15.160
Whoops, I cut myself.

00:16:19.530 --> 00:16:21.490
Can you get me a band-aid?

00:16:27.270 --> 00:16:28.300
Mom!

00:16:42.490 --> 00:16:46.100
I hate being like this...

00:16:52.310 --> 00:16:55.320
Kanami, sorry to bother you so late.

00:16:55.320 --> 00:16:59.790
Are there any houses around here where people have suddenly moved back in?

00:16:59.790 --> 00:17:02.340
Or houses that you can hear people inside even though they're vacant?

00:17:04.910 --> 00:17:06.050
Mom...

00:17:08.210 --> 00:17:12.610
I'll feed you from now on.

00:17:12.610 --> 00:17:14.340
I don't know if I can do it every day.

00:17:14.870 --> 00:17:17.460
I don't know if it'll be enough.

00:17:17.460 --> 00:17:20.370
But please bear with it.

00:17:24.300 --> 00:17:25.530
Sorry.

00:17:27.350 --> 00:17:30.360
Hello, Motoko-san!

00:17:31.250 --> 00:17:32.840
Sorry to bother you so late!

00:17:33.690 --> 00:17:36.270
Motoko-san, we need to talk!

00:17:36.270 --> 00:17:38.160
Don't worry.

00:17:38.160 --> 00:17:39.370
Motoko-san?

00:17:40.420 --> 00:17:41.680
Wh-What's that?!

00:17:41.680 --> 00:17:42.700
This isn't a clinic!

00:17:42.700 --> 00:17:44.370
It's a nest of shiki!

00:17:45.840 --> 00:17:48.320
Kanami! Kanami!

00:17:51.820 --> 00:17:53.430
Motoko!

00:17:53.430 --> 00:17:55.910
Shigeki melted...

00:17:55.910 --> 00:17:58.230
That old bastard!

00:17:58.230 --> 00:18:00.870
That rotten old bastard! Rotten old bastard!

00:18:00.870 --> 00:18:02.140
Calm down!

00:18:03.740 --> 00:18:06.160
You need a shower!

00:18:06.160 --> 00:18:07.640
You smell terrible!

00:18:07.640 --> 00:18:10.650
Just get in the bathroom, I'll bring you a change of clothes!

00:18:11.230 --> 00:18:13.340
It's dark in here, Kanami.

00:18:14.650 --> 00:18:15.760
Why?

00:18:18.200 --> 00:18:19.530
What?

00:18:22.410 --> 00:18:23.580
Motoko!

00:18:25.410 --> 00:18:28.490
Please, pretend you didn't see that.

00:18:28.490 --> 00:18:30.080
Huh? Why?

00:18:31.420 --> 00:18:32.920
She rose.

00:18:33.660 --> 00:18:37.420
But she won't attack anyone — ever.

00:18:37.420 --> 00:18:39.340
She promised.

00:18:39.340 --> 00:18:40.540
So please just act like you saw nothing.

00:18:40.540 --> 00:18:42.780
<i>My mom died...</i>

00:18:42.780 --> 00:18:43.930
Oh.

00:18:44.490 --> 00:18:45.950
Motoko?

00:18:46.620 --> 00:18:47.930
Your mom, huh?

00:18:48.710 --> 00:18:50.630
Don't worry, I understand.

00:18:50.630 --> 00:18:52.340
I'm glad she came back.

00:18:52.340 --> 00:18:53.940
Thanks...

00:18:57.750 --> 00:18:59.000
Why?

00:18:59.000 --> 00:19:03.970
Why did that old bastard take Shihori and Shigeki with him?

00:19:03.970 --> 00:19:06.490
He left me nothing!

00:19:06.490 --> 00:19:07.950
Oh, Moto-chan!

00:19:09.860 --> 00:19:11.710
What's wrong with you? You smell terrible!

00:19:12.440 --> 00:19:14.710
Kanami has her mom...

00:19:15.350 --> 00:19:16.360
What?

00:19:17.410 --> 00:19:20.140
Kanami's mom came back.

00:19:20.140 --> 00:19:21.340
At Chigusa?!

00:19:21.340 --> 00:19:22.840
Let's go!

00:19:24.100 --> 00:19:26.100
That old bastard!

00:19:26.100 --> 00:19:27.580
That old bastard...

00:19:27.580 --> 00:19:29.120
They got the old man!

00:19:29.120 --> 00:19:30.730
Quick, gather everyone with a shotgun!

00:19:30.730 --> 00:19:32.810
It's that son of a bitch Sasaki!

00:19:33.980 --> 00:19:35.520
That old bastard...

00:19:37.810 --> 00:19:39.240
That old bastard...

00:19:39.970 --> 00:19:42.240
Oh, there you are, Moto-chan!

00:19:42.240 --> 00:19:44.380
Let's have a snack! We brought warm tea!

00:19:44.380 --> 00:19:46.230
That old bastard...

00:19:46.230 --> 00:19:48.240
Hurry up or it'll be all gone!

00:19:51.960 --> 00:19:53.250
That old bastard...

00:19:57.070 --> 00:19:57.680
Doctor!

00:19:57.680 --> 00:19:58.640
That old bastard...

00:19:58.970 --> 00:20:00.810
They're in Yamairi! Let's get a truck!

00:20:00.810 --> 00:20:02.790
Their base is in Yamairi!

00:20:02.790 --> 00:20:04.750
Where's Old Man Ookawa and the priest?!

00:20:04.750 --> 00:20:05.840
I'll go too!

00:20:05.840 --> 00:20:08.190
So they're hiding in Yamairi!

00:20:08.190 --> 00:20:09.640
Probably because it's deserted!

00:20:15.640 --> 00:20:22.780
That old bastard... That old bastard...

00:20:23.740 --> 00:20:28.780
That old bastard...

00:20:29.080 --> 00:20:29.300
Is that it?

00:20:29.300 --> 00:20:30.330
That old bastard...

00:20:30.330 --> 00:20:32.290
Yeah, we've hauled 'em all up.

00:20:32.590 --> 00:20:34.290
That old bastard...

00:20:36.290 --> 00:20:39.460
That old bastard... That old bastard...

00:20:45.100 --> 00:20:46.980
You can't hide!

00:20:46.980 --> 00:20:49.550
I won't let you do this!

00:21:11.690 --> 00:21:13.290
I win.

00:21:33.980 --> 00:21:40.890
Enveloped in darkness, I snuff my breath.

00:21:41.480 --> 00:21:48.170
Clad in the darkness, I suddenly grin.

00:21:48.570 --> 00:21:55.970
It's just my imagination; no one knows you.

00:21:56.010 --> 00:22:02.650
I'm just staring at the moon.

00:22:04.800 --> 00:22:11.840
Ah, I haunt the endless night.

00:22:12.290 --> 00:22:18.440
Ah, I just dream a dream of you.

00:22:19.820 --> 00:22:26.650
Ah, I haunt the endless night.

00:22:27.290 --> 00:22:34.460
Ah, I just dream a dream of you.

00:22:50.090 --> 00:22:53.090
Next Week's Preview

00:22:53.850 --> 00:22:56.840
This is the truth of the world.

00:22:58.060 --> 00:23:05.150
The peaceful world which takes order and orderly men for granted.

00:23:05.750 --> 00:23:11.500
They reject the very existence of those who oppose order, lacking the strength to accept them.

00:23:11.500 --> 00:23:13.490
Bearing their fangs, they cast them out.

00:23:14.220 --> 00:23:17.830
Only by doing so are they able to maintain their thin facade.

00:23:18.910 --> 00:23:22.150
Such a fragile world.
